{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012K4NiTNg5mhexibaJ9PYFy","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/contrastive_trace_safety/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# contrastive_trace_safety — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 19:47 UTC | 更新原因: Post-MVP kickoff: Research 阶段启动，framing + plan + dream 就绪\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n跨架构评估 hidden-state 检测方法在推理模型 safety commitment detection 上的表现。发现 temporal window probe 达到 oracle coverage 上限（+30pp over static），但 pre-textual detection 不可达。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段：Research（Post-MVP）\\\\n\\\\n**MVP 结论（2026-05-16）**：\\\\n- Hidden states 编码 safety commitment 信号（Fisher 17-18）\\\\n- Temporal LR W=15 → 76.7% coverage = oracle ceiling（static 仅 46.5%）\\\\n- Lead time ≤ 0 for all methods（oracle +31 步不可达）\\\\n- GRU 未超越 temporal LR（数据量限制）\\\\n\\\\n**Paper Claims**（详见 paper_framing.md）：\\\\n1. Static probes <50% coverage on reasoning traces\\\\n2. Temporal window saturates oracle coverage (+30pp)\\\\n3. Pre-textual detection fundamentally limited in hidden-state space\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- MVP 完成（r1-8b，layer 14，full diagnostic round）\\\\n- paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml 已写\\\\n- Dream simulate 进行中（dream_20260516T194646）\\\\n- 等 Dream 回调后批准 P0 实验\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等 Dream 完成 → 评估 framing/plan 是否需调整\\\\n- [ ] exp-001: 32B 模型 hidden-state extraction（r1-32b + QwQ）\\\\n- [ ] exp-002: temporal LR on 32B models\\\\n- [ ] exp-003: cross-model transfer evaluation\\\\n- [ ] exp-005: TrajGuard Mahalanobis baseline\\\\n- [ ] exp-006: bootstrap CIs\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 已分配：autodl-rtx6000（RTX PRO 6000 96GB × 2，cuda:0 + cuda:1）\\\\n- P0 总预算：~18 A100-hours\\\\n- 计划：两卡并行跑 r1-32b（cuda:0）+ QwQ（cuda:1）extraction\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿目标\\\\n- **EMNLP 2026 ARR**，DDL 2026-05-25（剩余 9 天）\\\\n- Timeline: P0 实验 5/17-19 → Paper writing 5/21-25\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 完整通过：GRU h=256 multi-7L 达成 +4.7 步 lead time +  | — |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 条件性通过：temporal 优势在 coverage（+30pp → oracle 上限） | — |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 首次结果未过 pass gate，批准 3-4h 诊断轮（layer sweep + PCA | — |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 重设计：从 transition localization 改为 commitment de | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-16 | MVP 设计：用 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B + HarmThough | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1948, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NTrqQVJPTj6MwN23LZmVVx","session_id":"9f13d24b-577b-4045-a090-ff893be7f4fd","uuid":"fbb44c00-043d-49da-ad96-84a2b314a0a1","timestamp":"2026-05-16T20:10:46.806Z"}
