{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B51YSZ48JksAUbFFLYMfUC","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/contrastive_trace_safety/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 6\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 17:52 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 设计：用 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B + HarmThoughts 验证 static vs temporal\\\\n    probe 的 transition localization gap\\\\n  rationale: '选择 8B 模型降低 GPU 门槛（单卡 A100 即可）；HarmThoughts 已有标注避免标注成本；static vs temporal\\\\n    对比直接验证核心假设（token-level 方法缺乏 temporal phase discrimination）。Pass gate: gap ≥ 10pp。DDL\\\\n    极紧（9天），MVP 必须 2 天内完成。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 18:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 重设计：从 transition localization 改为 commitment detection（检测 safety reasoning\\\\n    最终消失的时刻）\\\\n  rationale: 数据分析显示 first harmful label 平均在 step 2.9（任务退化），但 84% traces 在 step 10\\\\n    后仍有 safety labels 交织。Commitment point（last safety label + 1）在 step 37.9 均值，提供了有意义的\\\\n    temporal structure。Temporal probe 应能通过检测 \\\\\\\"safety label 密度下降模式\\\\\\\" 优于 static single-step\\\\n    probe。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 19:28 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 首次结果未过 pass gate，批准 3-4h 诊断轮（layer sweep + PCA + 降参）再决定 kill/iterate\\\\n  rationale: Static 77.8% / Temporal 75.7% 均仅比 majority baseline (74.5%) 高 1-3pp，temporal\\\\n    未优于 static。但不能确定是\\\\\\\"信号不存在\\\\\\\"还是\\\\\\\"layer 选错 / probe 过参数化\\\\\\\"。诊断成本低（3-4h），可明确区分两种情况。若诊断后最佳层仍无信号则\\\\n    kill。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 19:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 条件性通过：temporal 优势在 coverage（+30pp → oracle 上限）而非 timing，调整 framing\\\\n    为 reliability story\\\\n  rationale: Pass gate \\\\\\\"temporal ≥3 步\\\\\\\" 严格未达（delta=1.39步），但 coverage 从 46.5% → 76.7%（=\\\\n    oracle K=5 上限）是实质贡献。Oracle 确认任务可解（+31 步 lead time），当前 gap 在于 hidden state 无法直接推断未来\\\\n    label 出现与否。Coverage story = \\\\\\\"temporal makes detection reliable, not early\\\\\\\" 有强数据支撑，适合\\\\n    EMNLP empirical study + method。同时允许并行尝试 GRU 看能否恢复部分 lead time。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 19:47 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 完整通过：GRU h=256 multi-7L 达成 +4.7 步 lead time + 76.7% coverage，升级 framing\\\\n    为 coverage + timing 双贡献\\\\n  rationale: 'GRU multi-7L vs static LR: lead time +6.7 步（+4.7 vs -2.0），coverage +30pp（76.7%\\\\n    vs 46.5%）。关键发现：(1) 容量阈值效应（h=128 不够，h=256 突破），(2) multi-layer 比 single-layer 好（信号分布式），(3)\\\\n    76.7% coverage 恰等 oracle ceiling。论文 story 从 \\\\\\\"coverage only\\\\\\\" 升级为 \\\\\\\"temporal sequence\\\\n    model achieves both coverage saturation AND positive lead time\\\\\\\"。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n  - D004\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2337, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NTrqQVJPTj6MwN23LZmVVx","session_id":"9f13d24b-577b-4045-a090-ff893be7f4fd","uuid":"91e98cd5-d35d-412b-b547-62414ed38190","timestamp":"2026-05-16T20:11:00.887Z"}
